      "hash64": "9364298E4642F873",
      "text": "Sì!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "93642A8E4642FA26",
      "text": "Il giusto...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "EE5436582F6D2814",
      "text": "Grande! Benissimo! Si vedeva anche da come\\nhai preparato quel panino piccantissimo![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "6640CDD8967BC082",
      "text": "Alla faccia del giusto! Il panino piccantissimo\\nche hai preparato ha bruciato tutti i record![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "EE5439582F6D2D2D",
      "text": "A me ovviamente piace da matti! Non so se si\\nnota dalla padella che mi porto appresso, eh eh![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "EE5438582F6D2B7A",
      "text": "I miei hanno un ristorante, e in futuro lo voglio\\ngestire io![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "EE5433582F6D22FB",
      "text": "Mi sono iscritto in questa scuola solo perché\\nsono stato invitato dal Preside![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "EE5432582F6D2148",
      "text": "Per questo vedere Riben e Aris lottare...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "EE5435582F6D2661",
      "text": "... e infiammarsi così tanto da fare scintille è\\nstata una bella sorpresa![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "EE5434582F6D24AE",
      "text": "Le lotte di Pokémon sono incredibili perché\\nriescono a infuocare la gente![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "EE542F582F6D1C2F",
      "text": "Anche a me è venuta voglia di provare ad alzare\\nun po’ la fiamma![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "4600615FCBEC4FF6",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], senti![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
